WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.810
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.580
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:22.050
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.820
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.490
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:36.470
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:45.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:56.500
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.700
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.360
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.480
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:20.380
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:40.240
Don’t be blinded Lacock!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:46.870
You must not submit to your anger
and challenge Devilman!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.480
Wait! Wait, I say!

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:55.450
Defeating Devilman is not your mission!

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.510
Do you understand me, Lacock?

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.620
I'm afraid I cannot follow
your orders, Demon Lord.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:06.860
I shall avenge Alron and my followers
by killing Devilman!

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:10.630
Demon Marshal, you intend to defy me?

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.990
You are prepared to die in vain?

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.980
Wait! I order you to wait!

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:25.180
DEMON MARSHAL LACOCK
THE FROZEN ACADEMY

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.190
NAKADO ACADEMY

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.160
I'm no good at this!

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:41.560
Please go easy on me!

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.370
You really think I'd do that?

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.490
Here we go!

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:53.480
Strike!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.480
You're a mess, Hairo!

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.310
All right!

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.480
That's it, there we go!

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:03.710
Come on!

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.710
Here it comes!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.820
Tare, you can do it!

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:15.920
Go for it!

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.910
- There!
- I've got it!

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.140
Come on!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.210
All right!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.300
- Okay!
- There!

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:22.020
Hey, what's the matter guys?

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.230
Hey, Todaiji!

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.260
That's funny...

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.970
Hey, Takada!

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:36.470
It's no good.
Everyone's frozen like mannequins!

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:41.050
I hope the animators didn't
go on strike or something.

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:49.390
Everybody, wake up!
Get up already!

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:53.030
Hey, what's the matter with everybody?

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:57.660
Man, I can't understand any of this!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.700
Oh no!

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.870
Oh my, excuse me.
Hey, please tell me!

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.510
Why are you sleeping
with your eyes open?

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:13.750
Rude!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.850
Hey, why are you standing there?

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.920
Fine, then!

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.150
Is anybody out there moving?

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:25.290
Call me an idiot all you want!

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.890
- Just say somethin--
- Lala!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.460
Devilman!
Uh, I mean Akira!

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.830
It's okay, you can call me Devilman.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.300
All the humans are frozen stiff.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.000
But, why aren't they moving?

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.630
They are moving. Look very carefully!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.580
See? They're moving a little at
a time, like ants!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.690
It's like they're walking through a desert!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.320
I think time has just slowed down.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.550
Time's slowed down?

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.750
I'm pretty dumb, so I don't get it.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:04.260
It means that for them, one second
lasts thirty minutes, or even an hour.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.800
I don't really understand it either.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.560
Go ask Einstein!

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:10.430
Where is he?
Where can I find him?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.770
Idiot! I was just making a point!

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:16.580
No! You called me an idiot again!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.180
What's that?

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:22.190
Wow, they look like stars!

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:38.170
- The Demon Marshal!
- You're right!

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:41.030
Look out!

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.540
It has been a long time, Devilman.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.810
Dammit! You show yourself,
Demon Marshal!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.550
DEVIL!

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.560
Devil- Oh no!

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:16.500
Damn, have you come here to kill me?

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:21.600
Would you care to know?
I shall tell you.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:24.970
Demon Lord Xenon tried to
stop me from coming here.

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:28.980
He said it is not the Demon
Marshal's duty to defeat Devilman.

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.080
What?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.950
Yet, here I am.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:37.580
You should feel honored, Devilman.
That is how important you are.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:39.530
Oh please!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.900
I am the only one who can defeat you.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:47.070
It is I alone who shall kill you.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:49.970
Take this!

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.060
Devil Kick!

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.050
This is hopeless.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.560
Devil Wing!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.660
Let's go, Demon Marshal!

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.370
Wait!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.750
Devil Cutter!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.260
All right!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.220
Devilman!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.420
Hooray! Hooray! Devilman!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:26.800
Lala is here to cheer for you!
Muwah!

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.210
Look out!
Get out of here, Lala!

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.440
I warned you, idiot!

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:49.260
Cool, it's like he's in a washing machine!

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.410
At this rate, I'm going to die!
All right!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.980
Hang in there, Devilman!

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.480
Dammit!

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:05.100
Woah, it broke!

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.970
It's coming right at me!

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.150
It's the Demon Marshal!

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.400
It appears I'm victorious!

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.250
You have simply won
in a childish quarrel.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.420
Here on will be much more frightening.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.420
Childish quarrel?

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:05.660
Do you think I am bluffing?
Well then...

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.870
It's just as I said!

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:20.110
Dammit, is that your last resort?

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.780
Devil Wing!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:28.480
Once more!

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:30.620
Devil Wing!

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:37.160
No matter how strong you
may be, my hair will never break!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:42.690
As the humans say, a
woman's hair is her life!

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.460
In that case...

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.630
Devil Kick!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.040
You can do it, Devilman!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:01.280
That crack...

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:03.420
Devil Kick!

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.090
Damn...

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.160
There's another face under the old one!

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:20.830
Suffer, Devilman!

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.040
You damn monster!

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:58.630
You call us of the
Demon Tribe “monsters“?

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:01.870
I see you are becoming
like the humans!

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.250
There!

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:09.040
Suffer, Devilman!

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:12.610
You, who call the Demon
Tribe monsters, shall die!

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:14.560
C-Can't breathe!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.460
Devil Cutter!

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:21.570
Is this the best you can do?

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.000
Killing you quickly would be a waste.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.070
I must make you pay for
what you did to Alron!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:14.410
How is that?
You have lost your wings, Devilman.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:16.290
You can't even fly!

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.140
What a feeling!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.130
Take this!

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.280
I can't watch!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:54.820
Damn!

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:57.800
Am I hearing things? I swear
I can hear another voice.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:17.640
You can do it, Devilman!
You can't give up!

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.780
If you do, you'll
never see me again!

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.420
Lala...

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.580
Go find it! Go find it-

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.460
Lala, go find it!

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:34.620
Go find it!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:35.660
What?

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.900
The Demon Marshal's belt buckle!

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.680
I think I know where it is...

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:47.680
If I'm right, that is the
Demon Marshal's life source!

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.370
What are you grumbling about?

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.840
Now, it's time for you to die!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.770
Hey, I found it!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.810
Is this it, Devilman?

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:58.780
Throw it! Throw it, Lala!

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.020
Blast!

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:02.220
What?

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.130
It's hopeless.

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:17.100
The game is mine in the end, is it not?

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.400
Damn! Damn!

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.740
Stupid Demon Marshal!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.010
I've got it!

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:26.950
Devil Arrow!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.290
All right!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.300
Devil Kick!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.640
Devil Chop!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.420
All right...

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:09.290
Devil Beam!

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:04.800
Oh boy, my butt feels better now!

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:08.180
I shouldn't have eaten
all those sweet potatoes!

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:14.160
I almost didn't get any
lines for this episode!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.560
Oh no-- What the?

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:31.970
I got it this time!

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:33.210
Huh?

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:38.280
Fudo, are you there?

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.250
That was just a test.
But not this time!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.920
All right, here it goes!

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:57.090
He did it!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.930
Yay, Hairo!

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.960
Amazing!

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:09.010
That was easy!

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:15.940
Nobody has a clue that
Devilman saved them.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:19.450
It must be sad, being a
hero who fights for justice.

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:49.870
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:56.580
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:04.230
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:10.080
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:14.030
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.240
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:22.240
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:33.090
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:53.120
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:59.320
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:04.810
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:11.950
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.700
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.700
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:26.410
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:36.530
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:12.130
When Mt. Fuji erupts, Demon Magdler
is reborn from his underground rest.

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:19.300
This headless demon turns the
city and its people into ash.

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:37.510
Farewell, Devilman!

00:23:37.510 --> 00:23:38.950
Oh, listen to me.

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:41.650
I'm still a romantic, right until I die.

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:44.150
Lala!

00:23:48.090 --> 00:23:50.190
What a bastard!

00:23:50.190 --> 00:23:51.860
I love you.

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:07.580
To save the people, Devilman stakes
his traitor's name to fight him.

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:12.860
Let's go, Magdler!

00:24:28.430 --> 00:24:31.500
But as long as the blazing
magma remains on the Earth,

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:33.810
Magdler will not lose his power to fight.

00:24:34.570 --> 00:24:38.500
But in the face of a demon
of such enormous power,

00:24:38.510 --> 00:24:41.940
Devilman's attacks are useless.

00:24:41.940 --> 00:24:43.640
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:43.640 --> 00:24:47.150
DEMON MAGDLER
THE FLYING LAVA
